{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE15defaultPositionyQrAA9UnitPointVF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI13UtilityWindowV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"defaultPosition(_:)","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultPosition"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"position"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","text":"UnitPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that specifies where to place a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"newly opened window relative to the screen bounds.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"position"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default position for new windows."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first time your app opens a window from a particular scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declaration, the system places the window at the center of the screen by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. For scene types that support multiple simultaneous windows, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system offsets each additional window by a small amount to avoid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completely obscuring existing windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can override the default placement of the first window by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applying a scene modifier that indicates where to place the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relative to the screen bounds. For example, you can request that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system place a new window in the bottom trailing corner of the screen:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultPosition(.bottomTrailing)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system aligns the point in the window that corresponds to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint"},{"type":"text","text":" with the point in the screen that corresponds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the same unit point."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You typically use one of the predefined unit points — like"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint\/bottomTrailing"},{"type":"text","text":" in the above example — but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can also use a custom unit point. For example, the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier aligns the point that’s one quarter of the way from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leading edge of the window with the point that’s one quarter of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the way from the leading edge of the screen, while centering the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window in the y-dimension:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["WindowGroup {","    ContentView()","}",".defaultPosition(UnitPoint(x: 0.25, y: 0.5))"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier affects any scene type that creates windows in Windows,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"namely:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings","isActive":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value that you provide acts only as an initial default. During state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restoration, the system restores the window to the position that it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last occupied."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/defaultposition(_:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a default position for a window."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/defaultPosition(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A specialized window scene that provides secondary utility to the content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the main scenes of an application."}],"title":"UtilityWindow","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UnitPoint":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UnitPoint"}],"title":"UnitPoint","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/unitpoint","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UnitPoint"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A normalized 